        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1459",
            "repere": "Texte · Light therapy with the Novaa Deep Healin",
            "text": "Light therapy with the Novaa Deep Healing Therapy Pad",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s1461",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I have been using photonic light therapy",
            "text": "I have been using photonic light therapy now for probably almost 20 years and have bought various products over the years for my whole family. I got the hand held unit from Novaalab and was so impressed with how much easier it was to sort of set it and forget it on spots that might be difficult to reach, when I saw the pad I ordered a few of them for family but lastly for me. I few weeks ago my left arm hurt so badly that I couldn't straighten it out OR bring it up to my mouth with a fork to eat so I used the light pad. Used it again in the morning and by later in the morning, all the pain was gone! Amazing! I do realize though, if you have something that is chronic, it will take much longer so don't give up. It took a long time to develop in some cases and will take repeated treatments daily over some period of time.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
